# VS Code Status Bar Configuration

Generates visual styles for the VS Code editor status bar (bottom bar only).

## Instructions

1. Create a `.vscode` folder in the project root if it doesn't exist
2. Generate visual styles configuration specifically for the bottom status bar
3. Apply the configuration to `.vscode/settings.json`
